Maintainer: Dario Griffo <dariogriffo@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/akinomyoga/ble.sh
Package: ble.sh
Version: BLESH_VERSION-BUILD_VERSION~griffo
Architecture: SUPPORTED_ARCHITECTURES
Depends: procps
Suggests: ble.sh-airline-themes
Description: Bash Line Editor -- a line editor written in pure Bash
 Bash Line Editor (ble.sh) is a command line editor written in pure Bash which
 replaces the default GNU Readline, enabling syntax highlighting, auto
 suggestions, vim modes, etc. in Bash interactive sessions.
 .
 Enable it by sourcing /usr/share/blesh/ble.sh from ~/.bashrc, see
 /usr/share/doc/ble.sh/README.Debian.
